+            "name": "Classifier-free diffusion guidance control",
+            "arxiv_id_or_url": "2207.12598",
+            "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.12598",
+            "implementation_over_stack": (
+                "Keep a no-external-verifier guidance control so Carnot energy is "
